<description>&lt;p&gt;Saddam Haftar is promoting a rebuilt flood-damaged town as a showcase of his rule while the Fezzan Revolutionaries Force continues to contest his control in the south. The House of Representatives speaker criticised Tripoli for blocking a parliamentary session in Zintan, and the closure of Zintan airport sparked further parliamentary clashes. Large drug seizures of cocaine and millions of pills were reported in eastern Libya as trafficking networks expand. The United Nations welcomed new laws criminalising the conscription of minors and raising the recruitment age to 18. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOUF92cEV2aUZOZTdpZzRjNVk1dzVCTjhkaUVGODZyem1EQzhvckhpNkc3a3FseW1JVzdZTmFyWEcyMU03Z2RoWnZxUmt0ZWtFZFJXMzlMWmtzM3JhVWJ5c0ZwTTVKcWVsODhjS1I4X21laFFaeVZMY3drUUliLUlDT21kMnpYQ0hjQ2JfQlVnbkVpMDlvSERvNkwxaU5BWkUzYmpXbWdPSk1VdmpFLWhPMjQ0YXhQaFBGUERuNW04WjhpdVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQZzNVX2NPYXpBVE1pZmVJOEdPcnJJeVYtcW5LTThGcHNuWFY5dnFFQXZhUGdxQURCd00wWndoVWdGNGRxM0xPOUR4T3IwVVNyXzl4enl0dlB1OHV0N0xvSlJ2d2JVaUJZbjJFYnJSX0Z1NkJ1dmRJSXk4NWxwRjV0Z29ZUkJJQmJIQWJ2end0TGpDc1ppcDZ2ZG54T0NWYkVlNWRKOE1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQQVZ2Y091ZGdXV0s0OXg3WDN5LVdNQjJLNW00VnpVck9ST19zN0ZQeEtzdTFXYlRCbkE3X2QxNUxLbzY4N3dpZ3VvVGJvVXhvZ2dHQktCT3VyVlpmUENjeDBkalRaV21GWDR6ZEF1QTFUUlk2Rm10MEM0ZkphWTQwdU9PYkkwZmU2Y2s2X29KRi1SMERSaFVxR1FvTjE5cVVzSWtRaGNFZEQ3a3VHMmdFOVNYYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;EU Reporter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNTjJnaU44RW12bW1pYzBHbTUwYkZXNXRicVgyNkM2b3RJNTQ3Rl9CS0R4TEFsZHFHcFVhbmFSbldRRXpmWHdtbWNHMVUyOFYzby1lQjdGMnY